    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's hard to talk about \"ways to connect\" when there's nothing to connect to. it's like i'm watching a movie of someone else's life. even when i'm walking around outside, it feels like i'm just a glitch in the background. everything feels so heavy and meaningless. i don't see the point in trying to ground myself if the ground itself doesn't feel real.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
